{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370120","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1037012001:1":{"text":"おや、意外そうだね？","source_cn":"你好像很惊讶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D38EE85BFE24D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037012002:1":{"text":"別に不思議じゃあないよ。森の植物は常に枯れては栄えての繰り返し、ここで暮らすミサタ様の子らも同じさ。","source_cn":"这没什么好奇怪的。丛林的植被每时每刻都在枯荣转换，生活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0067020A16765966","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037012003:1":{"text":"若い頃のイミルはハンサムで聡明で優しかった、森中が彼を讃えていたよ。","source_cn":"年轻时的伊米尔英俊睿智又善良，那时的丛林一直在传颂着他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F37AF28B98D7410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037012004:1":{"text":"でも残念なことに、落ち葉は多くを覆い隠し、多くを変えてしまった。","source_cn":"可惜……落叶掩埋了许多，也改变了许多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6F2DC2BD316FBD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1037012005:1":{"text":"結局のところ、落ち葉の中で一度も変わらずに一生を終えられる者の方が少ないのさ。","source_cn":"说到底，又有几个人能在落叶里始终如一地过完一生呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41D2889272DEB12D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fe